  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-09-14T01:12:59.148Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Harassing users become more offensive if they know who blocked them. Some of them resort to name-calling against those who block them in games or on social media. We use the block function to protect ourselves from harassment, but now we are afraid to use it. I believe the risk of harassers knowing who blocked them is greater than the confusion caused by anonymous blocking.\n\nThis is almost the same as using mute and hide avatar, and it defeats the purpose.",
